Subject: [PATCH 08/30] tests: Drama 3 backbone and tower oracles, replays and
 stage traces

Drivers that check the native backbone and tower against captured reference tensors, replay single operators
against them, and trace each stage for attribution, plus tf-cuda-test drama-conv and drama-qk on synthetic rows.
None of them runs as part of the host tests.
